e piece you've never said out loud, and the grip it has on you starts to loosen.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/pluto/chiron/conjunction","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":null,"body":"Transiting Pluto conjunct your Chiron parks itself on your sore spot for years, turning it all the way up until you can't manage around it anymore. It surfaces as an obsessive replay of an old memory, or a relationship that keeps circling back to the same core insecurity no matter how the details change. Pluto unearths exactly what's been buried under years of coping, bringing up details you thought you'd forgotten. You don't have to excavate the whole thing alone. Tell someone the piece you've never said out loud, and the grip it has on you starts to loosen.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","source_keys":["aspects-phase1-v1/aspect.pluto.conjunction.chiron","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"note":"Phase 1 exact transit-aspect unit, imported verbatim.","approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Pressure can make the actual stakes clearer for {{Name}}, particularly where an old sensitivity and its present trigger has been carrying an unresolved imbalance. An ordinary interaction can bring back a familiar reaction that makes more sense once they remember where they learned it. The contact concentrates the power arrangement becoming harder to ignore around one part of life, which can make a familiar pattern easier to recognize because it is harder to avoid.\n\nPluto {{aspectWord}} their Chiron continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from separating the current event from the older history before deciding what response the present 