e sore spot gives up more power than it costs you to look.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","source_keys":["aspects-phase1-v1/aspect.pluto.trine.chiron","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"note":"Phase 1 exact transit-aspect unit, imported verbatim.","approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A situation around {{Name}} may reveal more leverage than anyone has been naming, especially around the history attached to a sore point. The useful clue is the part that feels older than the event itself, especially if the same reaction has shown up in very different situations. The support is useful because pressure exposing the underlying issue can move toward action without another problem having to force it.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Pluto {{aspectWord}} their Chiron stays active. {{Name}} can acknowledge the sensitivity without giving it sole authority over the decision.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"88d0d0709391d84d51c671ff9931a336b4848b5d808b6092de8efa7a0104976b","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"88d0d0709391d84d51c671ff9931a336b4848b5d808b6092de8efa7a0104976b","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":null,"body_they":"A situation around {{Name}} may reveal more leverage than anyone has been naming, especially around the history attached to a sore point. The useful clue is the part that feels older than the event itself, especially if the same reaction has shown up in very different situations. The support is useful because pressure exposing the underlying issue can move toward action without another problem having to force it.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Pluto {{aspectWord}} their Chiron stays active. {{Name}} can acknowledge the sensitivity without giving it sole authority over the decision.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.137Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","source_keys":["aspects-phase1-v1/aspect.pluto.trine.chiron","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"Phase 1 exact transit-aspect unit, imported verbatim.","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.137Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/any/chiron/conjunction","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"If it still stings, it isn't finished.","summary":"Transiting planet over natal Chiron (wound-pressed template)","body":"Something recent hit an old sore spot, and your reaction was bigger than the moment deserved. That gap between the trigger and the response is useful information: it marks exactly what got managed instead of processed. You don't owe anyone composure about it. You do owe yourself the debrief: what got touched, when it started, who's safe to tell. Shame doesn't come out in the wash. It comes out in the telling. Tell it once, properly, and the same trigger gets a smaller response next time. Eventually, none at all.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/any/chiron/conjunction","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"If it still stings, it isn't finished.","body":"Something recent hit an old sore spot, and your reaction was bigger than the moment deserved. That gap between the trigger and the response is useful information: it marks exactly what got managed instead of processed. You don't owe anyone composure about it. You do owe yourself the debrief: what got touched, when it started, who's safe to tell. Shame doesn't come out in the wash. It comes out in the telling. Tell it once, properly, and the same trigger gets a smaller response next time. Eventually, none at all.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored library (final voice)","source_keys":["TLDR-Aspect-Samples-Batch11-Chiron.md","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"note":"Transiting planet over natal Chiron (wound-pressed template)","approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored library (final voice)","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The issue becomes specific enough for {{Name}} to respond to now, with the difference between an old hurt and the current event carrying most of the consequence. They may notice the urge to protect the sore spot before deciding if the person in front of them is actually repeating the old pattern. The two concerns sit close together now, so the issue moving from background to action immediately changes how {{Name}} experiences the situation instead of arriving as a separate issue.\n\nAs this transit {{aspectWord}} their Chiron continues through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} does better when they protect the sore spot without assuming that protection has to become withdrawal or retaliation.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"56a2949a6201e8be77c5994743c0ebc6ac28c99d6d46ea62dadc8e9ff1664fd0","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"e