 to {{Name}}, especially around how other people meet their presence. Someone may react to their tone, pace, appearance, or confidence before there is time for a fuller explanation. The easier contact helps most when a feeling changing what seems urgent becomes part of something specific they can finish, send, decide, or change. Their Ascendant gets the most from the option that still looks useful after the initial lift or relief settles.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Moon {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant favors one practical response: {{Name}} benefits from answering the situation in front of them instead of rehearsing how they might be judged later.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"cbbd6654617f6fb9d175549527a9c26a3b051ab0b6b686eeab20cdc6bc1df21e","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"cbbd6654617f6fb9d175549527a9c26a3b051ab0b6b686eeab20cdc6bc1df21e","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":null,"body_they":"A change in mood can make one part of the day feel much larger to {{Name}}, especially around how other people meet their presence. Someone may react to their tone, pace, appearance, or confidence before there is time for a fuller explanation. The easier contact helps most when a feeling changing what seems urgent becomes part of something specific they can finish, send, decide, or change. Their Ascendant gets the most from the option that still looks useful after the initial lift or relief settles.\n\nThrough {{unti