eir Chiron benefits from a second look because the first emotional meaning is not the only one available. Recognizing the old pattern is useful without making the current person carry its history.\n\nAs Moon {{aspectWord}} their Chiron continues through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} does better when they protect the sore spot without assuming that protection has to become withdrawal or retaliation.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"f5a319d6ed1198684c32127525995791d482b63a6533ed929ba7b9da61f50765","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"f5a319d6ed1198684c32127525995791d482b63a6533ed929ba7b9da61f50765","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":null,"body_they":"A need that was easy to ignore earlier can become obvious to {{Name}} through the difference between an old hurt and the current event. They may notice the urge to protect the sore spot before deciding if the person in front of them is actually repeating the old pattern. The effect is immediate enough that instinct reacting before explanation arrives quickly changes the practical meaning of the situation for {{Name}}. Their Chiron benefits from a second look because the first emotional meaning is not the only one available. Recognizing the old pattern is useful without making the current person carry its history.\n\nAs Moon {{aspectWord}} their Chiron continues through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} does better when they protect the sore spot without assuming that protection h