","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.138Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/moon/c/soft/variant-B","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"Kindness reaches deeper than usual today.","summary":"","body":"Today is good for the soft conversations: the apology, the check-in, the talk you've both been avoiding. Old hurts are easier to touch without flinching. If someone opens up, stay with it. Days like this are made for mending.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/moon/c/soft/variant-B","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"Kindness reaches deeper than usual today.","body":"Today is good for the soft conversations: the apology, the check-in, the talk you've both been avoiding. Old hurts are easier to touch without flinching. If someone opens up, stay with it. Days like this are made for mending.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored library (final voice)","source_keys":["TLDR-Aspect-Samples-Batch12-SoftVariants.md","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored library (final voice)","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A change in mood can make one part of the day feel much larger to {{Name}}, especially around the difference between an old hurt and the current event. They may notice the urge to protect the sore spot before deciding if the person in front of them is actually repeating the old pattern. The opening still needs action. A feeling changing what seems urgent makes cooperation or timing easier, but it does not complete the task on {{Name}}'s behalf. Their Chiron gives them a clearer clue once they compare the immediate reaction with what is still true an hour later. Recognizing the old pattern is useful without making the current person carry its history.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Moon {{aspectWord}} their Chiron favors one practical response: {{Name}} does better when they protect the sore spot without assuming that protection has to become withdrawal or retaliation.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"2f6575e725b1f43ffca9682808a2d87a195f7b2eb446ed36c847a620887ea0c0","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"2f6575e725b1f43ffca9682808a2d87a195f7b2eb446ed36c847a620887ea0c0","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":null,"body_they":"A change in mood can make one part of the day feel much larger to {{Name}}, especially around the difference between an old hurt and the current event. They may notice the urge to protect the sore spot before deciding if the person in front of them is actually repeating the old pattern. The opening still needs action. A feeling changing what seems urgent makes cooperation or timing easier, but it does not complete the task on {{Name}}'s behalf. Their Chiron gives them a clearer clue once they compare the immediate reaction with what is still true an hour later. Recognizing the old pattern is useful without making the current person carry its history.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Moon {{aspectWord}} their Chiron favors one practical response: {{Name}} does better when they protect the sore spot without assuming that protection has to become withdrawal or retaliation.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.138Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-authored library (final voice)","source_keys":["TLDR-Aspect-Samples-Batch12-SoftVariants.md","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_a