 change the emotional tone of how they think through the next choice quickly for {{Name}}. A small wording problem can create more work than the actual disagreement if everyone starts answering what they assumed was meant. The opening still needs action. Mood changing the scale of the moment makes cooperation or timing easier, but it does not complete the task on {{Name}}'s behalf. Their Mercury becomes more useful as information once the first burst of urgency is no longer choosing the scale of the problem. A short message or conversation may be enough to move the practical part.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Moon {{aspectWord}} their Mercury favors one practical response: {{Name}} can save time by correcting the misunderstanding early instead of winning an argument about a version nobody intended.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"4111238f702bd2cadf5d961fa0629df2295a4c9419d0484d0eaa5d3fea3511c4","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"4111238f702bd2cadf5d961fa0629df2295a4c9419d0484d0eaa5d3fea3511c4","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":null,"body_they":"One ordinary event can change the emotional tone of how they think through the next choice quickly for {{Name}}. A small wording problem can create more work than the actual disagreement if everyone starts answering what they assumed was meant. The opening still needs action. Mood changing the scale of the moment makes cooperation or timing easier, but it does not co