transit-aspect","headline":"The next chapter needs more of you, not less.","body":"For a long time you've been waiting for the right direction to announce itself, some sign that it's safe to commit. Meanwhile everything keeps pointing back at the same place: you, undiluted. The traits you've spent years softening to be easier to work with are the same ones the next stretch of your life is built on. This isn't a season for editing yourself into someone more acceptable. It's a season for finding out what happens when you stop. Your difference is the blueprint, and it always was.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored library (final voice)","source_keys":["TLDR-Aspect-Samples-Batch10-Nodal.md","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"note":"em dashes converted to commas per style rule","editorial_notes":"Anchor: Authenticity shelf, closer quoted (\"Your difference isn't a flaw, it's the blueprint\"). Source: Spring, planet conj NN as \"North Node Medicine… something this planet embodies that you need to bring into your life more.\"","approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored library (final voice)","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"{{Name}} may be offered a next step that feels slightly ahead of their experience around pride and the choices that feel like theirs. A plan can receive praise and still leave them unsure if it represents what they actually want to keep building. The transit is close enough to the natal point that the next step arriving before full confidence becomes difficult to separate from the choice in front of {{Name}}.\n\nAs the North Node {{aspectWord}} their Sun through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from strengthening what they genuinely want to build than from defending a version that mainly exists to keep approval coming.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"21116e71d46