ement at home may become easier to handle, especially when everyone involved is willing to focus on the current problem instead of reopening every old one. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Moon until {{untilDate}} gives you enough distance to deal with what usually feels too tender to touch.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The unfinished or under-supported part of the situation becomes visible to {{Name}} through private needs competing with the rest of the day. A family need may arrive after a long workday, or one frustrating message can follow them into a part of the day that did not cause it. What usually takes more effort may move with less resistance while authority making the requirement specific is working with the situation instead of against it.\n\nWhile Saturn {{aspectWord}} their Moon until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from protecting sleep, food, privacy, and recovery than from demanding a clean emotional answer on the hardest part of the day.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"409cf1bedd4e62d1737550c4f3e485f491bfb5253266991bf3d6c6fb9e455228","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","bod