atience for being needed, or find old guilt waiting for you the second the house goes quiet. Work keeps borrowing from home, or home needs more than you have left after work.\n\nTake the mood seriously, but do not let it write the whole story. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Moon until {{untilDate}} shows where duty takes more than it gives back, and where you need sleep, privacy, or one person who needs nothing from you.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/saturn/moon/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The inner critic gets louder, and comfort gets harder to reach. You may need more time alone, have less patience for being needed, or find old guilt waiting for you the second the house goes quiet. Work keeps borrowing from home, or home needs more than you have left after work.\n\nTake the mood seriously, but do not let it write the whole story. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Moon until {{untilDate}} shows where duty takes more than it gives back, and where you need sleep, privacy, or one person who needs nothing from you.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The unfinished or under-supported part of the situation becomes visible to {{Name}} through private needs competing with the rest of the day. A family need may arrive after a long workday, or one frustrating message can follow them into a part of the day that did not cause it. This transit can make the problem feel like it needs a total answ