em the old arrangement kept recreating and gives you more freedom without leaving a second crisis behind. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} helps you turn the urge for change into something you can actually live with.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A deadline, refusal, or practical constraint can make {{Name}} deal with freedom and a routine that has become too narrow more directly than they planned. An unexpected option can show that the old method was being repeated more from habit than from evidence that it still worked. The day makes authority making the requirement specific easier for {{Name}} to use well, especially if they attach the good feeling or useful timing to a specific next step.\n\nSaturn {{aspectWord}} their Uranus continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from testing one deliberate change before reorganizing everything around the frustration.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"4a37d833bea3bda29de9af7a7dd5977f82e06009d201622b29d07e69f2676208","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordP