upt exit, or decision made mainly to feel free again.\n\nDecide what you can actually afford to leave. Then change the part that is truly stuck instead of wrecking the whole arrangement. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} presses hardest where freedom has been postponed, but where leaving suddenly could create a second problem before it solves the first one.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/saturn/uranus/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The urge to quit, bolt, or tear up the plan builds quietly: the job that deadens you, the routine that never changes, or the obligations that keep answering not yet. When the pressure has nowhere to go, it can come out as a sudden resignation, abrupt exit, or decision made mainly to feel free again.\n\nDecide what you can actually afford to leave. Then change the part that is truly stuck instead of wrecking the whole arrangement. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} presses hardest where freedom has been postponed, but where leaving suddenly could create a second problem before it solves the first one.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A limit becomes concrete for {{Name}}, and disruption and the part that needs updating is where the consequence is hardest to avoid. The need for freedom may be legitimate even if the first solution that appears is more disruptive than necessary. Pressure rises when unfinished wor