l,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"You may be less reactive, clearer about your limits, and easier for other people to rely on. Responsibility does not have to arrive as a crisis before you take it seriously, and people may begin trusting your follow-through without needing a long explanation first.\n\nAn experienced person may become a mentor, advocate, or useful contact, especially when you ask practical questions and apply what you learn. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} helps you become more selective about what you agree to carry and what you leave with the person it belongs to.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/saturn/ascendant/soft","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"You may be less reactive, clearer about your limits, and easier for other people to rely on. Responsibility does not have to arrive as a crisis before you take it seriously, and people may begin trusting your follow-through without needing a long explanation first.\n\nAn experienced person may become a mentor, advocate, or useful contact, especially when you ask practical questions and apply what you learn. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} helps you become more selective about what you agree to carry and what you leave with the person it belongs to.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A deadline, refusal, or practical constraint can make {{Name}} deal with first impressions and immediate responses more directly than they planned. A new setting can make the difference between their first instinct and their preferred response easier to notice. There is enough cooperation here for responsibility turning into consequence to produce a result instead of only a better mood.\n\nSaturn {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} does better when they let the first reaction settle before changing how they present themselves to everyone else.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"05d904d8230996695f4c37fe7021bb78a34651cec30235ec34617904382559a6","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"05d904d8230996695f4c37fe7021bb78a34651cec30235ec34617904382559a6","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"You may be less reactive, clearer about your limits, and easier for other people to rely on. Responsibility does not have to arrive as a crisis before you take it seriously, and people may begin trusting your follow-through without needing a long explanation first.\n\nAn experienced person may become a mentor, advocate, or useful contact, especially when you ask practical questions and apply what you learn. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} helps you become more selective about what you agree to carry and what you leave with the person it belongs to.","body_they":"A deadline, refusal, or practical constraint can make {{Name}} deal with first impressions and immediate responses more directly than they planned. A new setting can make the difference between their first instinct and their preferred response easier to notice. There is enough cooperation here for responsibility turning into consequence to produce a result instead of only a better mood.\n\nSaturn {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} does better when they let the first reaction settle before changing how they present themselves to everyone else.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.203Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f23