 history is the only reason it still exists. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} makes your time more limited, which reveals who shows up without needing to be chased.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Saturn chapters","Hamaker-Zondag, Aspects (cross-check)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final v2, chat 2026-07-28 (conditional predictions)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A limit becomes concrete for {{Name}}, and how they enter a new situation is where the consequence is hardest to avoid. They may catch themselves changing how they speak or carry themselves because one person's reaction suddenly feels important. The difficult contact exposes something worth addressing, but a limit becoming concrete does not require an all-or-nothing answer.\n\nThe useful part of Saturn {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant until {{untilDate}} is concrete. {{Name}} gets more from showing up clearly than from trying to manage every impression in advance.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"03437aa8c9a4596f9a6448c5d830bab6bca7bfa8f1fe8b73436388cc92c1a60c","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256