t than any single success. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Sun until {{untilDate}} can make the gap between where you are and where you expected to be feel wider than it is.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/chiron/sun/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Feedback gets under your skin faster than usual: a dismissed idea, work that gets passed over, or a person whose approval you wanted going quiet. It can wake an older question about whether what you make matters at all. The person who set it off is the trigger, not the cause; the sore spot was already there. Continuing to show up in public does more to quiet the doubt than any single success. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Sun until {{untilDate}} can make the gap between where you are and where you expected to be feel wider than it is.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-27 (no-imperatives wound register)","source_keys":["Greene, Chiron in Love","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-27 (no-imperatives wound register)","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something ordinary can carry more history than expected for {{Name}} when it reaches pride and the choices that feel like theirs. A plan can receive praise and still leave them unsure if it represents what they actually want to keep building. What needs correction becomes clearer when {{Name}} treats old history coloring a current event as a signal rather than a command.\n\nAs Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Sun through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from strengthening what they genuinely want to build than from defending a version that mainly exists to keep approval coming.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256"