ces, and what makes the arrangement sustainable. They may know how to keep the interaction pleasant and still need to say the number, preference, boundary, or request that gives the pleasant tone something solid to rest on. The friction matters because a vulnerability becoming easier to name can move faster than the part of the situation that needs judgment, so the first reaction may create more work than the original problem.\n\nChiron {{aspectWord}} their Venus runs through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} can enjoy what is available without using pleasure or approval as a reason to skip the conversation the situation still needs.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"65c4ab183a38a0a6f8286d8bfd5d4b71f5060db7d9d0238f0b85dda23ce0604d","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"65c4ab183a38a0a6f8286d8bfd5d4b71f5060db7d9d0238f0b85dda23ce0604d","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Doubt about being lovable can creep back in. The mirror gets meaner, compliments fail to land, and testing whether someone cares often replaces asking directly for reassurance. Those tests rarely yield a clear answer; they usually leave the other person confused and the distance wider. A hard stretch does not make your body, your relationship, or your worth evidence against you. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Venus until {{untilDate}} can make an old rejection feel current, even when the present is telling a different story.","body_they":"{{Name}} may recogni