nd, decide, or change.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Saturn favors one practical response: {{Name}} can use the pressure to identify what needs a stronger system, clearer ownership, more time, or a smaller promise.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"a857739c86e0b3d197c0eebec9bdb52a5803dc30e541804043e9e3f4786ab4b5","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"a857739c86e0b3d197c0eebec9bdb52a5803dc30e541804043e9e3f4786ab4b5","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Old deprivations are easier to name without shame: the things you did not get, the years you carried too much, or the loneliness underneath the discipline. A fellow outsider, often older, can become a real ally now. Saying the true thing to one safe person makes the weight easier to carry. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Saturn until {{untilDate}} lets the responsible part of you admit what it cost.","body_they":"{{Name}} may recognize an old sore point inside a present-day situation involving the practical consequence of an under-supported plan. A refusal from an authority figure can be frustrating and still clarify the exact rule, requirement, or weakness that has to be dealt with. The easier contact helps most when a vulnerability becoming easier to name becomes part of something specific they can finish, send, decide, or change.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Saturn favors one practical response: {{Name}} can use the p