ially around disruption and the part that needs updating. The need for freedom may be legitimate even if the first solution that appears is more disruptive than necessary. The conflict gets clearer once {{Name}} separates what actually changed from the extra pressure created by a familiar sore point resurfacing.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Uranus stays active. {{Name}} does better when they preserve what still works and change the part that is actually causing the restriction.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"2c64c1080dfa777356763286eafa10bb225ab3978558a66f2d40059881f09860","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"2c64c1080dfa777356763286eafa10bb225ab3978558a66f2d40059881f09860","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Being ahead of the room starts to carry a price: your ideas or way of living may get dismissed, and a group you belonged to can suddenly feel like the wrong fit. Disillusionment with a scene, movement, or institution is common here. Us-versus-them thinking feels like clarity in the moment, but it mostly deepens the isolation. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} can make seeing differently feel lonelier than usual.","body_they":"A current moment may touch an older sensitivity for {{Name}}, especially around disruption and the part that needs updating. The need for freedom may be legitimate even if the first solution that appears is more disruptive than necessary