er)","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something ordinary can carry more history than expected for {{Name}} when it reaches restlessness around a stale pattern. A schedule flips, a device fails, another person changes direction, or a routine becomes intolerable at exactly the wrong moment. This is easier energy, not automatic results. Old history coloring a current event helps most when {{Name}} gives it a concrete job.\n\nWhile Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Uranus until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more information from a small experiment than from an impulsive break made at the peak of irritation.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"d0c7b74807a22372db3652b73b1c896e3056ef3a9fdc19e19e8b03433128794a","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"d0c7b74807a22372db3652b73b1c896e3056ef3a9fdc19e19e8b03433128794a","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The parts of you that never fit get easier to own: the odd interest, the minority opinion, or the path nobody else in the family took. People who see it your way are easier to find, and old exclusions carry less charge. Building something with the difference works better than just defending it. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} can turn being the odd one out into a workable position.","body_they":"Something ordinary can carry more history than expected for {{Name}} when it reaches restlessness