son whose intensity dominates the room, waking up an older feeling of powerlessness. Naming a villain feels like quick relief, but it rarely changes the dynamic. The real leverage stays at the small scale: avoiding petty spite and quiet revenges. Chiron {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} can wake the old fear of being at someone's mercy, even when you have more room to maneuver than it feels like.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-27 (no-imperatives wound register)","source_keys":["Greene, Chiron in Love","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-27 (no-imperatives wound register)","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A current moment may touch an older sensitivity for {{Name}}, especially around control and the actual leverage involved. The pressure may show where an arrangement depends on one person having more information, money, authority, or emotional leverage than the others. Pressure rises when a familiar sore point resurfacing pushes against a need that cannot simply be rushed, enlarged, softened, or controlled into compliance.\n\nThe useful part of Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Pluto until {{untilDate}} is concrete. {{Name}} does better when they change the structure that keeps producing the problem rather than checking the same outcome for reassurance again.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"1848982bd082b07888741fc201845e80d55c2f1ddc79e6006c57433cad6e6a63","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends 