lDate}} can let what once hurt you become part of what you are known for.","body_they":"Something ordinary can carry more history than expected for {{Name}} when it reaches the work other people can evaluate. A manager, client, audience, or decision-maker may respond to the result before they know how much work happened behind it. {{Name}} can use old history coloring a current event while the timing is cooperative instead of waiting for urgency to create momentum.\n\nWhile Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Midheaven until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from a concrete result than from spending the same energy trying to manage everyone's opinion of the result.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.205Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-27 (no-imperatives wound register)","source_keys":["Greene, Chiron in Love","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallbac