ontent_key":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/jupiter/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"Everything wants to grow at once: commitments, spending, plans, appetite. Several projects may peak in the same month, and the confidence to take on more arrives before the time or money needed to carry it.\n\nExpansion can hold when you put in as much as you expect to receive. Overcommitted, the period sends its invoice after the excitement of saying yes has passed. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Jupiter until {{untilDate}} shows you which opportunities are real and which only looked manageable before they all landed on the same calendar.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/jupiter/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Everything wants to grow at once: commitments, spending, plans, appetite. Several projects may peak in the same month, and the confidence to take on more arrives before the time or money needed to carry it.\n\nExpansion can hold when you put in as much as you expect to receive. Overcommitted, the period sends its invoice after the excitement of saying yes has passed. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Jupiter until {{untilDate}} shows you which opportunities are real and which only looked manageable before they all landed on the same calendar.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Jupiter chapters","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The larger option is easier for {{Name}} to imagine right now, especially around how much they are willing to take on. An opportunity can be genuine and still come with more work, money, travel, or responsibility than the first conversation mentions. The difficult contact exposes something worth addressing, but optimism outrunning the practical details does not require an all-or-nothing answer.\n\nWith Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Jupiter until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} does better when they separate genuine opportunity from the part that only feels persuasive because it is bigger.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"0b9fe8c758cd2bd757bd4f632da6660bb6b07b57c49c8e5847367e695a000479","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"0b9fe8c758cd2bd757bd4f632da6660bb6b07b57c49c8e5847367e695a000479","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Everything wants to grow at once: commitments, spending, plans, appetite. Several projects may peak in the same month, and the confidence to take on more arrives before the time or money needed to carry it.\n\nExpansion can hold when you put in as much as you expect to receive. Overcommitted, the period sends its invoice after the excitement of saying yes has passed. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Jupiter until {{untilDate}} shows you which opportunities are real and which only looked manageable before they all landed on the same calendar.","body_they":"The larger option is easier for {{Name}} to imagine right now, especially around how much they are willing to take on. An 