ure.\n\nA financial decision may go wrong because the facts are difficult to verify and everyone involved believes their own story. Postpone what can wait. Verify what cannot. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Neptune until {{untilDate}} can make hope feel like evidence, especially around money, spiritual promises, and anyone selling a complete transformation.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/neptune/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Everything looks possible and nothing looks like a trap, which is exactly the problem. The pitch sounds airtight. The cause feels unquestionable. The plan seems to need only a little faith and a signature.\n\nA financial decision may go wrong because the facts are difficult to verify and everyone involved believes their own story. Postpone what can wait. Verify what cannot. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Neptune until {{untilDate}} can make hope feel like evidence, especially around money, spiritual promises, and anyone selling a complete transformation.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Jupiter chapters","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Good news or a new possibility can widen {{Name}}'s expectations quickly, particularly around uncertainty and the facts easiest to blur. A strong feeling can contain useful information without proving every story attached to it. The difficult part is the mismatch between the impulse to expand before checking the cost and what the situation can realistically support right now.\n\nJupiter {{aspectWord}} their Neptune continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from postponing what can wait and checking the fact that matters most on what cannot.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"a73bda9f52c0f91fd5d0e4550890e5f366684f153334d4ed338c5786444a004b","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"a73bda9f52c0f91fd5d0e4550890e5f366684f153334d4ed338c5786444a004b","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Everything looks possible and nothing looks like a trap, which is exactly the problem. The pitch sounds airtight. The cause feels unquestionable. The plan seems to need only a little faith and a signature.\n\nA financial decision may go wrong because the facts are difficult to verify and everyone involved believes their own story. Postpone what can wait. Verify what cannot. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Neptune until {{untilDate}} can make hope feel like evidence, especially around money, spiritual promises, and anyone selling a complete transformation.","body_they":"Good news or a new possibility can widen {{Name}}'s expectations quickly, particularly around uncertainty and the facts easiest to blur. A strong feeling can contain useful information without proving every story attached to it. The difficult part is the mismatch between the impulse to expand before checking the cost and what the situation can realistically support right now.\n\nJupiter {{aspectWord}} their Neptune continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from postponing what can wait and che