r more, spend more, or take a bigger chance around what keeps producing consequences behind the scenes. They may notice how much effort has been going into checking, managing, or controlling something that still does not feel safer. The opening still needs action. Confidence moving toward the larger option makes cooperation or timing easier, but it does not complete the task on {{Name}}'s behalf.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Pluto favors one practical response: {{Name}} can use influence to resolve the underlying problem without turning the solution into proof that they were the most powerful person involved.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"c46b144ad351804512d60dc5da18d1e2d0a0504241007ecdee73cca2bd352b0b","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"c46b144ad351804512d60dc5da18d1e2d0a0504241007ecdee73cca2bd352b0b","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"A stalled negotiation may finally move. Someone with authority may support the change you have been trying to make, or you may have enough backing to address a problem everyone else learned to work around.\n\nThe support is more likely to last when the people affected can see how the change helps them too. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} may give an ambitious plan more reach, but the strongest version does not require everyone else to absorb the cost.","body_they":"{{Name}} may feel more willing to ask for more, spend more, or take a bigger chance around what keeps producing consequences behind the scenes. They may notice how much effort has been going into checking, managing, or controlling something that still does not feel safer. The opening still needs action. Confidence moving toward the larger option makes cooperation or timing easier, but it does not complete the task on {{Name}}'s behalf.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Pluto favors one practical response: {{Name}} can use influence to resolve the underlying problem without turning the solution into proof that they were the most powerful person involved.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.207Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Jupiter chapters","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceF