ople have a reason to support it. A win forced through without them may only schedule the next fight. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} raises the stakes around how you use authority, money, access, or information other people need.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Jupiter chapters","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"An opening can make the whole situation look more promising to {{Name}}, with the issue underneath the surface argument becoming the place where expansion is most tempting. An ultimatum, hidden expense, private resentment, or question of access can reveal that the official explanation was only part of the problem. What feels urgent is not always the same thing as what deserves the strongest response, especially while a bigger appetite for possibility is already amplifying the stakes.\n\nAs Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Pluto through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from putting the hidden term on the table than from trying to win a surface argument that leaves the power arrangement untouched.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"9fdd8719112c1fe1b30e12cefab62e42136820f462ddf5a3c0ff8090d6fe6796","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approv