Name}} may feel more willing to ask for more, spend more, or take a bigger chance around a public role and what comes with it. A title, assignment, review, deadline, or question of credit can make the public stakes of the work more obvious. The friction matters because generosity becoming easier to promise can move faster than the part of the situation that needs judgment, so the first reaction may create more work than the original problem.\n\nJupiter {{aspectWord}} their Midheaven runs through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} can treat professional scrutiny as information about the work without turning it into a verdict on their worth.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"af9f624bea40c320048b2366a8876af93a6410ef1ffd2820f9c359ab00b7fb27","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"af9f624bea40c320048b2366a8876af93a6410ef1ffd2820f9c359ab00b7fb27","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The career accelerates, and the appetite accelerates faster. Recognition may arrive, or you may begin expecting it. More scope, more staff, more visibility, and more responsibility can all look like obvious growth before anyone works out how the current structure will support it.\n\nGrowth made now may hold when the money, authority, time, and support are already in place. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Midheaven until {{untilDate}} can bring a real opportunity with a workload the current role cannot carry. The difference may not become obvious until af