"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.207Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/descendant/trine","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"Jupiter trine your Descendant","summary":"","body":"Until {{untilDate}}, other people can make a project or plan much easier to move forward.\n\nJupiter in Leo is trining your natal Descendant, opening up practical opportunities through partnerships, collaborators, clients, and people who are actually willing to meet you halfway. Someone makes the introduction, agrees to the meeting, offers real support, or finally wants to talk about what comes next. You do not have to push every door open by yourself right now.\n\nPay attention to the connections where effort goes both ways and there is genuine room for both of you to benefit. Say yes when an opportunity is worth pursuing, but take a look at the actual terms and timeline before you commit. A good offer should still make sense after the initial excitement calms down.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/descendant/trine","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"Jupiter trine your Descendant","body_you":"Until {{untilDate}}, other people can make a project or plan much easier to move forward.\n\nJupiter in Leo is trining your natal Descendant, opening up practical opportunities through partnerships, collaborators, clients, and people who are actually willing to meet you halfway. Someone makes the introduction, agrees to the meeting, offers real support, or finally wants to talk about what comes next. You do not have to push every door open by yourself right now.\n\nPay attention to the connections where effort goes both ways and there is genuine room for both of you to benefit. Say yes when an opportunity is worth pursuing, but take a look at the actual terms and timeline before you commit. A good offer should still make sense after the initial excitement calms down.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"exact owner wording, Codex task 2026-08-21","source_keys":["packages/astro-knowledge/review/jupiter-descendant-trine-owner-approval-2026-08-21.json","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"editorial_notes":"Owner-approved You transit detail. The date remains engine-owned through {{untilDate}}.","approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/jupiter-descendant-trine-owner-approval-2026-08-21.json","payloadSha256":"cae955ad20c123d01e2c0601a16852ecf61078da6e1b9ea789315c35c507ada0","approvedAt":"2026-08-21"},"body_they":"The larger option is easier for {{Name}} to imagine right now, especially around the terms of a close agreement. Another person's response can clarify which relationships actually make more possible and which ones only add another obligation. The advantage is practical: a bigger appetite for possibility is easier to direct toward something useful instead of spending the day managing friction around it.\n\nThe useful part of Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Descendant until {{untilDate}} is concrete. {{Name}} benefits from saying yes to cooperatio