s after your time has already run out.\n\nA useful contact may open a door, but an inflated promise can leave you owing more than you meant to give. In a close relationship, growth can deepen the connection when both people are moving in the same direction. Where one person's expansion keeps becoming the other person's burden, the relationship may become harder to continue. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} can grow your world faster than your schedule can hold.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit: Jupiter chapters","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Good news or a new possibility can widen {{Name}}'s expectations quickly, particularly around first impressions and immediate responses. A new setting can make the difference between their first instinct and their preferred response easier to notice. A sharp reaction can contain useful information and still be badly timed if optimism outrunning the practical details is making the situation feel more absolute than it is.\n\nJupiter {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} does better when they let the first reaction settle before changing how they present themselves to everyone else.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"8103d797b6fd62ebfa64baacebbb70a3e076032035e8fedee84140849a0e8049","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"8103d797b6fd62ebfa64baacebbb70a3e076032035e8fedee84140849a0e8049","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"More people, invitations, and opportunities can arrive at once. So can the expectation that you will answer everyone, attend everything, and remain generous after your time has already run out.\n\nA useful contact may open a door, but an inflated promise can leave you owing more than you meant to give. In a close relationship, growth can deepen the connection when both people are moving in the same direction. Where one person's expansion keeps becoming the other person's burden, the relationship may become harder to continue. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} can grow your world faster than your schedule can hold.","body_they":"Good news or a new possibility can widen {{Name}}'s expectations quickly, particularly around first impressions and immediate responses. A new setting can make the difference between their first instinct and their preferred response easier to notice. A sharp reaction can contain useful information and still be badly timed if optimism outrunning the practical details is making the situation feel more absolute than it is.\n\nJupiter {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} does better when they let the first reaction settle before changing how they present themselves to everyone else.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.207Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","p