elf may lose some of its grip. You may care more about helping, creating, or giving your hours to work that feels meaningful, and less about who notices first. Your imagination opens, but so does your need for sleep, privacy, and time away from constant demands.\n\nA creative or spiritual project may become more than an idea when you give it regular hours instead of waiting for inspiration to take over. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Sun until {{untilDate}} can make a larger purpose feel worth your time, especially when that purpose has a real place in your week.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/sun/soft","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Proving yourself may lose some of its grip. You may care more about helping, creating, or giving your hours to work that feels meaningful, and less about who notices first. Your imagination opens, but so does your need for sleep, privacy, and time away from constant demands.\n\nA creative or spiritual project may become more than an idea when you give it regular hours instead of waiting for inspiration to take over. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Sun until {{untilDate}} can make a larger purpose feel worth your time, especially when that purpose has a real place in your week.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A vague plan, strong feeling, or missing detail can matter more than expected for {{Name}} around pride and the choices that feel like theirs. A plan can receive 