nd home, family, and immediate emotional needs. They may understand the practical situation and still need time before their feelings catch up with what has changed. There is less resistance between a strong feeling blurring the practical facts and what the situation needs, which gives {{Name}} a better chance to use the opening deliberately.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Neptune {{aspectWord}} their Moon remains active. {{Name}} benefits from taking the mood seriously without treating it as the only evidence available.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"33509565e4194aac68427669bb62db74b22dab92f4223746c5ae420dd79ce7af","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"33509565e4194aac68427669bb62db74b22dab92f4223746c5ae420dd79ce7af","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"You may notice the mood in a room before anyone explains it. Home can feel more restorative, and small acts of care may matter more than usual: a cooked meal, a quiet evening, or time with someone who does not expect you to explain every feeling before they respect it.\n\nA family visit, home change, or caregiving arrangement may go well when the help is wanted and everyone knows what they are responsible for. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Moon until {{untilDate}} can make tenderness easier to give and receive without turning care into a debt.","body_they":"The line between intuition, hope, and assumption gets thinner for {{Name}} around home, family, and immediate e