d can feel impossible to continue and impossible to leave when guilt, rescue, or fear of being alone has become part of the attachment. Delay the final answer when you can. When you cannot, decide from the pattern you can document over time, not the panic of one difficult night. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Moon until {{untilDate}} can make emotional history feel like a current crisis.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The line between intuition, hope, and assumption gets thinner for {{Name}} around home, family, and immediate emotional needs. They may understand the practical situation and still need time before their feelings catch up with what has changed. The conflict is easier to use once imagination filling in missing details is separated from the part that genuinely needs action.\n\nNeptune {{aspectWord}} their Moon continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from taking the mood seriously without treating it as the only evidence available.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"99ef301e11204e85b35d717587222af93b7b5d6c3b089ec7157c3a090a6b094d","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"app