. Small kindnesses land. Time alone may feel peaceful instead of lonely.\n\nA connection begun or renewed now may last when it survives ordinary life: schedules, bills, bad moods, and an unglamorous Tuesday. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Venus until {{untilDate}} can make love feel finer than usual. Consistency tells you what the relationship can actually carry.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/venus/soft","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"An existing relationship may feel warmer, or a new connection may make ordinary life feel more beautiful for a while. Music, art, clothes, gardens, and the space around you can matter more than usual. Small kindnesses land. Time alone may feel peaceful instead of lonely.\n\nA connection begun or renewed now may last when it survives ordinary life: schedules, bills, bad moods, and an unglamorous Tuesday. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Venus until {{untilDate}} can make love feel finer than usual. Consistency tells you what the relationship can actually carry.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Sensitivity is turned up for {{Name}}, and affection, preferences, and what makes the arrangement sustainable may feel less definite than it usually does. They may know how to keep the interaction pleasant and still need to say the number, preference, boundary, or request that gives the pleasant tone something solid to rest on. The opening still needs action. Fatigue making assum