 name which one. Escape routes look brighter than they are. Days of intense inspiration alternate with days when making one basic decision feels impossible.\n\nA radical change may still be right when it stays reversible and does not bet the dependable parts of your life on a vague promise. Keep new commitments limited in time, money, and consequence until you know what is real. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} can create more desire for change than certainty about what should replace the old arrangement. Test one change before reorganizing your whole life around it.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/uranus/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"You want a different life more than you can name which one. Escape routes look brighter than they are. Days of intense inspiration alternate with days when making one basic decision feels impossible.\n\nA radical change may still be right when it stays reversible and does not bet the dependable parts of your life on a vague promise. Keep new commitments limited in time, money, and consequence until you know what is real. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} can create more desire for change than certainty about what should replace the old arrangement. Test one change before reorganizing your whole life around it.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Sensitivity is turned up for {{Name}}, and the change they need without