lusionment arrive mixed together, and only time separates them. The worst move is the fast, irreversible one: the affair, resignation, or reinvention announced before it exists. Let the question stay open. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Neptune until {{untilDate}} may expose how much of the current life was built around an idea you no longer believe. That does not mean every part has to be destroyed.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/neptune/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The achievements that used to satisfy you may stop satisfying you. The ten-year plan reads like someone else's goal list. Maintaining the identity takes more energy than it used to, and the question underneath becomes harder to avoid: how much of this did you actually choose?\n\nReal insights and temporary disillusionment arrive mixed together, and only time separates them. The worst move is the fast, irreversible one: the affair, resignation, or reinvention announced before it exists. Let the question stay open. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Neptune until {{untilDate}} may expose how much of the current life was built around an idea you no longer believe. That does not mean every part has to be destroyed.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A vague plan, strong feeling, or missing detail can matter more than expected for {{Name}} around hope, fatigue, and what still needs verification. A vague promise can sound complete because