y be benefiting from the fact that nobody can clearly explain what is happening.\n\nA destructive pattern may lose some of its power when it is named directly in therapy, conversation, or legal paperwork. Keep joint finances documented and move slowly. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} can bring hidden power dynamics closer to the surface. Clear records keep you from agreeing to terms nobody can explain.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/pluto/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"A compulsion, grief, fixation, or control battle may become harder to dismiss. Around shared money, business partnerships, or old agreements, unexplained delays and vague answers deserve closer attention. Someone may be benefiting from the fact that nobody can clearly explain what is happening.\n\nA destructive pattern may lose some of its power when it is named directly in therapy, conversation, or legal paperwork. Keep joint finances documented and move slowly. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} can bring hidden power dynamics closer to the surface. Clear records keep you from agreeing to terms nobody can explain.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Sensitivity is turned up for {{Name}}, and what keeps producing consequences behind the scenes may feel less definite than it usually does. They may notice how much effort has been going into checking, managing, or controlling something