erwork exact. Run expert advice past your own judgment. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} can make it harder to tell where generosity ends and agreement begins. The people worth keeping will still respect a clear no, a written term, and a need you state without apologizing.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/ascendant/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The line between your needs and other people's problems gets harder to see. You absorb moods that are not yours, agree to commitments you immediately regret, and lose track of how you are coming across to clients, friends, or partners. Being too accommodating attracts helpers and people looking for someone to carry what belongs to them.\n\nAn agreement, business deal, romance, or rescue arrangement may become costly when your needs remain unstated. Say what you want plainly. Keep the paperwork exact. Run expert advice past your own judgment. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} can make it harder to tell where generosity ends and agreement begins. The people worth keeping will still respect a clear no, a written term, and a need you state without apologizing.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","source_keys":["Tierney, Alive and Well with Neptune","Hand","Rodden","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28 (fog register + decision hygiene)","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The line between intuition, hope, and assumption gets thinner for {{Name}} around first impressions and immediate responses. A new setting can make the difference between their first instinct and their preferred r