}} your Sun until {{untilDate}} can show you where the current life has more room than you thought. Try the new role, schedule, or project before reorganizing your entire life around it.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"{{Name}} may want more freedom from a pattern that has become stale, with what they are trying to build under their own name making the need for change obvious. Pushback may feel personal when the work, decision, or role carries more of their identity than they realized. The easier flow is useful because independence pushing against a rigid arrangement can support the next step without requiring a crisis first.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Uranus {{aspectWord}} their Sun favors one practical response: {{Name}} can treat attention as feedback without making attention the measure of how much the work matters.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"6260a4ed8f4d1069a9d1a9f0b07ac7ebf3c471bed8277223bd0bcb0ac08dc22a","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"6260a4ed8f4d1069a