 this season, and the urge is to break them loudly: the resignation, the confrontation, the risk taken to prove a point.\n\nThe assertion may be overdue where you have kept quiet, accepted unfair terms, or avoided a necessary confrontation to preserve the arrangement. Give the energy hard physical outlets, and do not send the difficult email, sign the contract, or make the irreversible decision at the peak of the anger. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Mars until {{untilDate}} gives the anger more force. What you do before the confrontation decides whether it changes the arrangement or only creates another problem.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/uranus/mars/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The temper runs short and the tolerance runs shorter. Conditions you put up with for years become unbearable this season, and the urge is to break them loudly: the resignation, the confrontation, the risk taken to prove a point.\n\nThe assertion may be overdue where you have kept quiet, accepted unfair terms, or avoided a necessary confrontation to preserve the arrangement. Give the energy hard physical outlets, and do not send the difficult email, sign the contract, or make the irreversible decision at the peak of the anger. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Mars until {{untilDate}} gives the anger more force. What you do before the confrontation decides whether it changes the arrangement or only creates another problem.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"{{Name}} may want more freedom from a pattern that has become stale, with the task or confrontation that needs movement making the need for change obvious. The body may register the problem first through restlessness, tension, impatience, or the urge to do something immediately. The friction matters because the need for change arriving abruptly can move faster than the part of the situation that needs judgment, so the first reaction may create more work than the original problem.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Uranus {{aspectWord}} their Mars favors one practical response: {{Name}} can use the extra force on the task itself and wait until the peak of the anger passes before making the larger decision.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"37c75ed60499118765c98aec0061404fb54e8c29d13efa10966f39b1ccce6acf","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"37c75ed60499118765c98aec0061404fb54e8c29d13efa10966f39b1ccce6acf","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The temper runs short and the tolerance runs shorter. Conditions you put up with for years become unbearable this season, and the urge is to break them loudly: the resignation, the confrontation, the risk taken to prove a point.\n\nThe assertion may be overdue where you have kept quiet, accepted unfair terms, or avoided a necessary confrontation to preserve the arrangement. Give the energy hard physical outlets, and do not send the difficult email, sign the contract, or make the irreversible