oval comes through, someone offers access, or a burden that limited your choices becomes easier to carry. Optimism feels earned for a change.\n\nThe opening may be worth acting on when it shows you that a limit you accepted was never as permanent as it looked. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Jupiter until {{untilDate}} can widen your options through people, approvals, and opportunities you did not plan for.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A disruption can show {{Name}} where confidence and the cost of expanding has become too rigid or too dependent on one routine. A bigger purchase, broader plan, generous offer, or ambitious promise can look easier to support than it will feel later. This is easier energy, not automatic results. An unexpected change forcing improvisation helps most when {{Name}} gives it a concrete job.\n\nAs Uranus {{aspectWord}} their Jupiter through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from one supported expansion than from three promises competing for the same money and schedule.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"5a1079d32c99cba0a04f4006cb4c9da28da1c9c54a4dab90ab9ab7e34104c959","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"app