 feel safer than the numbers say it is. Keep an alternate plan, and let the sudden windfall sit before it gets spent. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Jupiter until {{untilDate}} can make a low-probability outcome feel more likely because it is exciting. Check the numbers before the possibility becomes a financial commitment.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/uranus/jupiter/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Confidence spikes and the bets get bigger. The scheme sounds brilliant, the gamble feels safe, and the sudden gain, if it comes, leaves as fast as it arrived. Someone else's big idea may be the most expensive item on offer.\n\nA speculative move may cost you when it rides on feeling lucky rather than being verified. Excitement may make the gamble feel safer than the numbers say it is. Keep an alternate plan, and let the sudden windfall sit before it gets spent. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Jupiter until {{untilDate}} can make a low-probability outcome feel more likely because it is exciting. Check the numbers before the possibility becomes a financial commitment.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something unexpected can force {{Name}} to improvise around risk, opportunity, and the size of the promise instead of repeating the usual solution. They may want to say yes before checking the budget, schedule, evidence, or number of people who will depend on that yes. The conflict is easier to use once disruption exposing a stale pattern is separated fr