Date}} exposes the distance between the life you built and the one you meant to live. The answer may require change, but it does not require the first dramatic exit available.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/uranus/uranus/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"This one runs on the calendar too: it lands around twenty-one, the early forties, and the early sixties, and asks the same question each time at higher stakes: is this the life you meant? At the midlife pass the urgency can feel like a last chance, and marriages, careers, and whole identities take the pressure.\n\nThe exits made in this urgency may be right or may just be urgent, especially when what actually needs changing is the direction of attention rather than the address. Give the restlessness experiments before you give it resignations. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} exposes the distance between the life you built and the one you meant to live. The answer may require change, but it does not require the first dramatic exit available.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something unexpected can force {{Name}} to improvise around freedom and a routine that has become too narrow instead of repeating the usual solution. An unexpected option can show that the old method was being repeated more from habit than from evidence that it still worked. A sharp reaction can contain useful information and still be badly timed if disruption exposing a stale pattern is making th