ilDate}} favors the career change you choose deliberately.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/uranus/midheaven/soft","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"A promotion, side project, or unfamiliar field may change what you thought your career had to look like. Technical, scientific, independent, or unconventional work can become relevant even when it was not part of the original plan.\n\nA redirection may succeed when it advances where you actually want to go rather than changing for the sake of it. The larger discovery may be that you want a different kind of working life, not only a different title. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Midheaven until {{untilDate}} favors the career change you choose deliberately.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The original plan may stop fitting {{Name}} as neatly as it did, especially around recognition and professional authority. A professional disagreement can become easier to handle once they separate the quality of the work from the politics around who gets recognized for it. Support is available in a form {{Name}} can actually use, and the need for change arriving abruptly is less likely to become the part they have to manage around.\n\nThe useful part of Uranus {{aspectWord}} their Midheaven until {{untilDate}} is concrete. {{Name}} does better when added responsibility comes with clear authority, time, pay, or ownership instead of only a more impressive title.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":