VE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"The relationship script comes up for review. Partners want new terms, roles that ran on autopilot stall, and your own patience for being managed drops to zero. New people are electric and unpredictable in equal measure.\n\nA partnership may survive and improve when both people want more room inside the relationship rather than an exit from it. In other cases, the demand for new terms may reveal that the old agreement no longer works for one or both people.\n\nContracts and legal disputes need the same clarity. When the goal shifts from solving the problem to proving a point, the cost can rise quickly. Get qualified advice before accepting new terms. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} changes how you meet people, negotiate agreements, and respond when someone else wants more freedom than the old arrangement allowed.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/uranus/ascendant/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The relationship script comes up for review. Partners want new terms, roles that ran on autopilot stall, and your own patience for being managed drops to zero. New people are electric and unpredictable in equal measure.\n\nA partnership may survive and improve when both people want more room inside the relationship rather than an exit from it. In other cases, the demand for new terms may reveal that the old agreement no longer works for one or both people.\n\nContracts and legal disputes need the same clarity. When the goal shifts from solving the problem to proving a point, the cost can rise quickly. Get qualified advice before accepting new terms. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} changes how you meet people, negotiate agreements, and respond when someone else wants more freedom than the old arrangement allowed.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul (pressure mechanics)","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner line-pass final (rev 4), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something unexpected can force {{Name}} to improvise around first impressions and immediate responses instead of repeating the usual solution. A new setting can make the difference between their first instinct and their preferred response easier to notice. Disruption exposing a stale pattern can sharpen the problem without making the biggest reaction the best response.\n\nUranus {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant stays active through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} does better when they let the first reaction settle before changing how they present themselves to everyone else.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"173329c300f32d772ad35f948aa79ca414859d1ba7f48f826dd1a9c92d583d99","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"173329c300f32d772ad35f948aa79ca414859d1ba7f48f826dd1a9c92d583d99","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The relationship script comes up for review. Partners want new terms, roles that ran on autopilot stall, and your own patience for being managed drops to zero. New people a