 else to decide what should happen next. Choose the project you are willing to have associated with your name for years.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/pluto/sun/soft","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"A manager may support the change you have been proposing, a decision-maker finally takes the meeting, or a project that kept stalling receives enough money, authority, or attention to move. People may begin asking for your judgment because you have already shown them what you can do.\n\nPluto {{aspectWord}} your Sun until {{untilDate}} can give your work more influence when you use the access instead of waiting for someone else to decide what should happen next. Choose the project you are willing to have associated with your name for years.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner review final (rev 2), chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Hand","Rodden","Jones, Healing the Soul","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner review final (rev 2), chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Pressure can make the actual stakes clearer for {{Name}}, particularly where identity and the work they want to stand behind has been carrying an unresolved imbalance. A moment of recognition can clarify which work makes them want to participate more fully and which success mainly looks good from the outside. Less friction around control becoming part of the argument makes the practical next step easier to see and use.\n\nPluto {{aspectWord}} their Sun stays active through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from protecting the part of the decision that actually represents them while remaining willing to fix the weak point around it.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"155c4ef9cd7ef98