ed grievance becoming specific stops choosing the urgency for them.\n\nPluto {{aspectWord}} their Ascendant runs through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from answering the situation in front of them instead of rehearsing how they might be judged later.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"a940fbc57af3a874d0ec4cdfd77abe7a566a8d07a5eb4782d51fa2dd3db34caf","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"a940fbc57af3a874d0ec4cdfd77abe7a566a8d07a5eb4782d51fa2dd3db34caf","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"A relationship gets intense enough to reorganize the year around it. A partner may demand the cards on the table, a fascinating person may hold more sway over you than the relationship explains, and your own need to control the terms can surface in ways other people react to before you notice.\n\nA confrontation may improve the relationship when both people state what they want and what they have been using to get it. Partial honesty leaves the same argument waiting for another opening. Where someone has unusual power over you, look at what the relationship is promising, withholding, or threatening to take away. That usually explains why the pull feels larger than the bond itself. Pluto {{aspectWord}} your Ascendant until {{untilDate}} renegotiates how close people get, and on what terms.","body_they":"Something that had been managed indirectly becomes harder for {{Name}} to keep managing that way, with how other people meet 