271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/sun/lilith/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"Your Lilith remembers what you learned to leave out so other people would find you easier to accept: the wants you stopped naming and the opinions that always became an argument. When the Sun crosses this point, those old compromises are harder to ignore. You may feel more tired, more irritable, or less willing to play along with people who express themselves freely while expecting you to stay agreeable. Keep the week lighter than usual and notice what keeps getting under your skin. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} brings one old compromise into full view before moving on quickly.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/sun/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith remembers what you learned to leave out so other people would find you easier to accept: the wants you stopped naming and the opinions that always became an argument. When the Sun crosses this point, those old compromises are harder to ignore. You may feel more tired, more irritable, or less willing to play along with people who express themselves freely while expecting you to stay agreeable. Keep the week lighter than usual and notice what keeps getting under your skin. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} brings one old compromise into full view before moving on quickly.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"{{Name}} may have less patience for the version of themselves that keeps everyone else comfortable. A preference they stopped mentioning, an opinion that always became a problem, or a reaction they learned to hide can become much harder to dismiss while this transit is active. Irritation may be the first sign that an old compromise is costing more than it used to.\n\nThey do not need to turn every feeling into a confrontation. They do need to notice which situation keeps producing the same resentment. With the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Lilith until {{untilDate}}, one part of {{Name}} that was edited out for acceptance wants to be acknowledged again. Naming it privately is already different from pretending it is not there.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"0f6263f96753a25801d11ae35c7075301121644d1b1192bac3ce47059571e872","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","payloadSha256":"0f6263f96753a25801d11ae35c707