ts, the same swallowed reply. Write down what set you off today and compare next month; the repeat shows you which compromise is wearing thin. The Moon conjunct your Lilith today shows which subject you are tired of avoiding, even if you are not ready to discuss it well yet.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/moon/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"The Moon crosses your Lilith for a day or two every month, and those days press on everything you keep quiet to keep the peace. You snap faster, feel dismissed faster, and want to poke at exactly the topic everyone avoids. It passes quickly, but it repeats: the same people, the same subjects, the same swallowed reply. Write down what set you off today and compare next month; the repeat shows you which compromise is wearing thin. The Moon conjunct your Lilith today shows which subject you are tired of avoiding, even if you are not ready to discuss it well yet.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A familiar situation can feel different to {{Name}} because anger around an old compromise carries more emotional weight today. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. The difficult contact exposes something worth addressing, but the body registering the situation quickly does not require an all-or-nothing answer.\n\nThe useful part of Moon {{aspectWord}} their Lilith until {{untilDate}} is concrete. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"8377ace7444bc97a72c683c0510298426168a13ad7633627f3a02887a1473e39","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"8377ace7444bc97a72c683c0510298426168a13ad7633627f3a02887a1473e39","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The Moon crosses your Lilith for a day or two every month, and those days press on everything you keep quiet to keep the peace. You snap faster, feel dismissed faster, and want to poke at exactly the topic everyone avoids. It passes quickly, but it repeats: the same people, the same subjects, the same swallowed reply. Write down what set you off today and compare next month; the repeat shows you which compromise is wearing thin. The Moon conjunct your Lilith today shows which subject you are tired of avoiding, even if you are not ready to discuss it well yet.","body_they":"A familiar situation can feel different to {{Name}} because anger around an old compromise carries more emotional weight today. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. The difficult contact exposes something worth addressing, but the body registering the situation quickly does not require an all-or-nothing answer.\n\nThe useful part of Moon {{aspectWord}} their Lilith until {{untilDate}} is concrete. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/mercury/lilith/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"Your Lilith holds the opinions you stopped saying because they started arguments, and the observations you keep to yourself because the room could not take them. While Mercury crosses this point, they push toward the surface: one topic circles your head on repeat, and staying quiet takes real effort. Say the true thing, but pick the room and the moment; the blurted version costs more than the planned one. Mercury {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} keeps bringing you back to the real subject. Once you name it, the conversation can finally be about what is actually wrong.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/mercury/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith holds the opinions you stopped saying because they started arguments, and the observations you keep to yourself because the room could not take them. While Mercury crosses this point, they push toward the surface: one topic circles your head on repeat, and staying quiet takes real effort. Say the true thing, but pick the room and the moment; the blurted version costs more than the planned one. Mercury {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} keeps bringing you back to the real subject. Once you name it, the conversation can finally be about what is actually wrong.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"app