nt; the blurted version costs more than the planned one. Mercury {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} keeps bringing you back to the real subject. Once you name it, the conversation can finally be about what is actually wrong.","body_they":"Messages and decisions move faster around {{Name}} under this transit, with anger around an old compromise becoming the part that needs an answer. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. The conflict gets clearer once {{Name}} separates what actually changed from the extra pressure created by facts arriving close to the decision point.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Mercury {{aspectWord}} their Lilith stays active. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/venus/lilith/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"Your Lilith knows what you learned not to want openly: the person, pleasure, style, or preference you kept private because admitting it would change how other people saw you. While Venus crosses this point, the embarrassment around those wants may loosen. You may feel more willing to admit what you like without defending it first. Enjoy what feels good, but do not treat every strong desire as a decision that has to be made immediately. Venus {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes honesty about pleasure feel less risky.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/venus/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith knows what you learned not to want openly: the person, pleasure, style, or preference you kept private because admitting it would change how other people saw you. While Venus crosses this point, the embarrassment around those wants may loosen. You may feel more willing to admit what you like without defending it first. Enjoy what feels good, but do not treat every strong desire as a decision that has to be made immediately. Venus {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes honesty about pleasure feel less risky.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Money, affection, or social ease can change the tone of the situation for {{Name}}, especially around a non-negotiable they stopped naming. A familiar compromise may start producing resentment faster than it used to, especially if they have been expected to stay agreeable about it. The first impulse may be understandable, but money or affection changing the tone still needs to be matched to the scale of the actual problem.\n\nWhile Venus {{aspectWord}} their Lilith until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} can stop volunteering for the compromise that reliably leaves them angry afterward.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"0b0ffab48e4debd903238ca08991c547e6900f9e575040823ee6ad8dccb63853","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_appro