l earlier moments. Write down what you wish you had said, bring it into therapy, or wait until you can have the conversation without turning every old grievance into one fight. Mars {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes the anger easier to reach and harder to mislabel.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/mars/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith holds the anger from every time you swallowed a reply because the job, the family, or the relationship needed you to stay quiet. While Mars crosses this point, that anger can surface quickly. The fuse runs shorter, and the argument in front of you may carry resentment from several earlier moments. Write down what you wish you had said, bring it into therapy, or wait until you can have the conversation without turning every old grievance into one fight. Mars {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes the anger easier to reach and harder to mislabel.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Urgency rises around {{Name}} when the part of the arrangement that keeps producing resentment stops being theoretical and starts requiring a response. They may hear themselves say yes and immediately realize the yes was meant to prevent someone else's reaction rather than reflect what they want. The tension is useful when it reveals the weak point. It becomes expensive when physical drive rising quickly turns that weak point into a fight about everything else.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Mars {{aspectWord}} their Lilith favors one practical response: {{Name}} gets more from a clear refusal or preference than from another round of being agreeable and privately furious.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"9d27b335f4e74bf006404e233f1187263b0ae0ee330a40927bf80f2b0a3fe2f4","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"9d27b335f4e74bf006404e233f1187263b0ae0ee330a40927bf80f2b0a3fe2f4","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Your Lilith holds the anger from every time you swallowed a reply because the job, the family, or the relationship needed you to stay quiet. While Mars crosses this point, that anger can surface quickly. The fuse runs shorter, and the argument in front of you may carry resentment from several earlier moments. Write down what you wish you had said, bring it into therapy, or wait until you can have the conversation without turning every old grievance into one fight. Mars {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes the anger easier to reach and harder to mislabel.","body_they":"Urgency rises around {{Name}} when the part of the arrangement that keeps producing resentment stops being theoretical and starts requiring a response. They may hear themselves say yes and immediately realize the yes was meant to prevent someone else's reaction rather than reflect what they want. The tension is useful when it reveals the weak point. It becomes expensive when physical drive rising quickly turns that weak point into a fight about everything else.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Mars {{aspectWord}} their Lilith favors one practical response: {{Name}} gets more from a clear refusal or preference than from another round of being agreeable and privately furious.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/lilith/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"Your Lilith remembers where you trained yourself to ask for less because wanting more made other people uncomfortable. While Jupiter crosses this point, what once felt unreasonable may start to look possible: the raise you never requested, more time to yourself, a larger role, more privacy, or a clearer no. Choose one area where you have been accepting less than you need and say what you want plainly to the person involved. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} changes what you consider reasonable to request.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith remembers where you trained yourself to ask for less because wanting more made other people uncomfortable. While Jupiter crosses this point, what once felt unreasonable may start to look possible: the raise you never requested, more time to yourself, a larger role, more privacy, or a clearer no. Choose one area where you have been accepting less than you need and say what you want plainly to the person involved. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} changes what you consider reasonable to request.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The larger option is easier for {{Name}} to imagine right now, especially around anger around an old compromise. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. The conflict gets clearer once {{Name}} separates what actually changed from the extra pressure created by the impulse to expand before checking the cost.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Lilith stays active. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"1fc1de452f182ed0c302642dacc9e9244d610b7a1b4c5fa60f0c9e34a8f3e419","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"1fc1de452f182ed0c302642dacc9e9244d610b7a1b4c5fa60f0c9e34a8f3e419","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Your Lilith remembers where you trained yourself to ask for less because wanting more made other people uncomfortable. While Jupiter crosses this point, what once felt unreasonable may start to look possible: the raise you never requested, more time to yourself, a larger role, more privacy, or a clearer no. Choose one area where you have been accepting less than you need and say what you want plainly to the person involved. Jupiter {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} changes what you consider reasonable to request.","body_they":"The larger option is easier for {{Name}} to imagine right now, especially around anger around an old compromise. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. The conflict gets clearer once {{Name}} separates what actually changed from the extra pressure created by the impulse to expand before checking the cost.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Lilith stays active. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/saturn/lilith/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"You may feel more pressure to tone yourself down to remain welcome at work, in your family, or within a group. Expectations tighten, and someone may prefer the version of you that is quieter, easier, or less likely to challenge the rules. Compromise where the cost is small, but notice the line where saying yes would make you resent yourself. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes the conditions of belonging harder to ignore.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/saturn/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"You may feel more pressure to tone yourself down to remain welcome at work, in your family, or within a group. Expectations tighten, and someone may prefer the version of you that is quieter, easier, or less likely to challenge the rules. Compromise where the cost is small, but notice the line where saying yes would make you resent yourself. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes the conditions of belonging harder to ignore.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A deadline, refusal, or practical constraint can make {{Name}} deal with the preference they usually make easy to ignore more directly than they planned. A preference they stopped mentioning can become harder to dismiss once the same old expectation appears again. Authority making the requirement specific can sharpen the problem without making the biggest reaction the best response.\n\nSaturn {{aspectWord}} their Lilith continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from naming the non-negotiable before resentment has to do all of the speaking for them.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"76d47e6bf7139395bc0bd21f1f2db91db4e2964d34f8cc9ede99849d35359164","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"76d47e6bf7139395bc0bd21f1f2db91db4e2964d34f8cc9ede99849d35359164","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"You may feel more pressure to tone yourself down to remain welcome at work, in your family, or within a group. Expectations tighten, and someone may prefer the version of you that is quieter, easier, or less likely to challenge the rules. Compromise where the cost is small, but notice the line where saying yes would make you resent yourself. Saturn {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes the conditions of belonging harder to ignore.","body_they":"A deadline, refusal, or practical constraint can make {{Name}} deal with the preference they usually make easy to ignore more directly than they planned. A preference they stopped mentioning can become harder to dismiss once the same old expectation appears again. Authority making the requirement specific can sharpen the problem without making the biggest reaction the best response.\n\nSaturn {{aspectWord}} their Lilith continues through {{untilDate}}. {{Name}} benefits from naming the non-negotiable before resentment has to do all of the speaking for them.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_stat