ents you no longer believe in, and once you have said the real answer out loud, going back rarely works.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/uranus/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith knows when the price of fitting in has become too high: the preference you stopped bringing up, the opinion you learned to keep to yourself, and the role you kept playing because too much of your job, family, or relationship depended on it. While Uranus moves across this point, staying quiet gets harder. You may finally say what you want, renegotiate an arrangement that stopped working, or set down a role you have been carrying for other people's comfort. Expect some pushback; the people the old arrangement served will notice first. Make one change at a time, and mean it. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes it harder to keep agreeing to arrangements you no longer believe in, and once you have said the real answer out loud, going back rarely works.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A disruption can show {{Name}} where a non-negotiable they stopped naming has become too rigid or too dependent on one routine. A familiar compromise may start producing resentment faster than it used to, especially if they have been expected to stay agreeable about it. What feels urgent is not always the same thing as what deserves the strongest response, especially while an unexpected change forcing improvisation is already amplifying the stakes.\n\nWhile Uranus {{aspectWord}} their Lilith until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} can stop volunteering for the compromise that reliably leaves them angry afterward.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"3312702708fdc0d49397776fa18d25544f2e69ccfe02e11a4fafdada1f6fdd71","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"3312702708fdc0d49397776fa18d25544f2e69ccfe02e11a4fafdada1f6fdd71","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Your Lilith knows when the price of fitting in has become too high: the preference you stopped bringing up, the opinion you learned to keep to yourself, and the role you kept playing because too much of your job, family, or relationship depended on it. While Uranus moves across this point, staying quiet gets harder. You may finally say what you want, renegotiate an arrangement that stopped working, or set down a role you have been carrying for other people's comfort. Expect some pushback; the people the old arrangement served will notice first. Make one change at a time, and mean it. Uranus {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes it harder to keep agreeing to arrangements you no longer believe in, and once you have said the real answer out loud, going back rarely works.","body_they":"A disruption can show {{Name}} where a non-negotiable they stopped naming has become too rigid or too dependent on one routine. A familiar compromise may start producing resentment faster than it used to, especially if they have been expected to