865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/lilith/hard","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"Your Lilith carries the preferences, opinions, and reactions you learned to associate with rejection or shame. While Neptune crosses this point, the pressure around them may become less obvious but harder to name. You may withdraw, stop explaining yourself, or spend more time alone because privacy feels easier than being misunderstood. Keep one regular connection to ordinary life, and give the private material somewhere to go through writing, music, art, or one trusted conversation. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} may make the old shame feel less sharp, but silence alone will not resolve it.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/neptune/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith carries the preferences, opinions, and reactions you learned to associate with rejection or shame. While Neptune crosses this point, the pressure around them may become less obvious but harder to name. You may withdraw, stop explaining yourself, or spend more time alone because privacy feels easier than being misunderstood. Keep one regular connection to ordinary life, and give the private material somewhere to go through writing, music, art, or one trusted conversation. Neptune {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} may make the old shame feel less sharp, but silence alone will not resolve it.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Sensitivity is turned up for {{Name}}, and the part of the arrangement that keeps producing resentment may feel less definite than it usually does. They may hear themselves say yes and immediately realize the yes was meant to prevent someone else's reaction rather than reflect what they want. The friction matters because lower energy making certainty harder to force can move faster than the part of the situation that needs judgment, so the first reaction may create more work than the original problem.\n\nAs Neptune {{aspectWord}} their Lilith continues through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from a clear refusal or preference than from another round of being agreeable and privately furious.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"e5b8ebba305be2012656901d3b981c94706aba873bcbd203512dcadd043dc328","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"e5b8ebba305be2012656901d3b981c94706aba873bcbd203512dcadd04