acceptable. Say what you have been absorbing, and leave room to hear what the other person has carried too. Some relationships can be rebuilt around more balanced expectations. In others, where one person has been taking advantage of the other, the connection may end before the transit does. Pluto {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes unequal terms much harder to live around.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/pluto/lilith/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Your Lilith notices where a close relationship depends on one person yielding more, staying quieter, or carrying more of the emotional cost. As Pluto crosses this point, those arrangements become harder to ignore. Long partnerships may have to discuss who decides, who adapts, and whose anger has been treated as more acceptable. Say what you have been absorbing, and leave room to hear what the other person has carried too. Some relationships can be rebuilt around more balanced expectations. In others, where one person has been taking advantage of the other, the connection may end before the transit does. Pluto {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes unequal terms much harder to live around.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A situation around {{Name}} may reveal more leverage than anyone has been naming, especially around anger around an old compromise. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. Pressure rises when the power arrangement becoming harder to ignore pushes against a need that cannot simply be rushed, enlarged, softened, or controlled into compliance.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Pluto {{aspectWord}} their Lilith stays active. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"e88960ee7e7f02c1c130ec927eb609ac2b2c4f8a9c02905c70b367f41044e7f9","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"e88960ee7e7f02c1c130ec927eb609ac2b2c4f8a9c02905c70b367f41044e7f9","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Your Lilith notices where a close relationship depends on one person yielding more, staying quieter, or carrying more of the emotional cost. As Pluto crosses this point, those arrangements become harder to ignore. Long partnerships may have to discuss who decides, who adapts, and whose anger has been treated as more acceptable. Say what you have been absorbing, and leave room to hear what the other person has carried too. Some relationships can be rebuilt around more balanced expectations. In others, where one person has been taking advantage of the other, the connection may end before the transit does. Pluto {{aspectWord}} your Lilith until {{untilDate}} makes unequal terms much harder to live around.","body_they":"A situation around {{Name}} may reveal more leverage than anyone has been naming, especially around anger around an old compromise. The strongest reaction may point to the place where they have been making themselves easier to accommodate instead of making the terms more honest. Pressure rises when the power arrangement becoming harder to ignore pushes against a need that cannot simply be rushed, enlarged, softened, or controlled into compliance.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Pluto {{aspectWord}} their Lilith stays active. {{Name}} does better when they distinguish a boundary from the urge to punish someone for crossing an old one.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.212Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d0743929