hat happened then from what is possible now.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","source_keys":["Walker, The Astrology of the Black Moon, ch.6","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved final rev 4, chat 2026-07-27","approvedAt":"2026-07-27","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A comment, delay, or small change can make {{Name}} more aware of an older sensitivity tied to the preference they usually make easy to ignore. A preference they stopped mentioning can become harder to dismiss once the same old expectation appears again. The conflict is easier to use once an older sensitivity becoming recognizable is separated from the part that genuinely needs action.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Chiron {{aspectWord}} their Lilith remains active. {{Name}} benefits from naming the non-negotiable before resentment has to do all of the speaking for them.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"8c6889d236762cd95c90560fa9c041091fd775ba18603536ec99c5cab99a9574","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"8c6889d236762cd95c90560fa9c041091fd775ba18603536ec99c5cab99a9574","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Your Lilith remembers the preferences, opinions, and reactions that once brought teasing, exclusion, or family disa