/north-node/conjunction","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"","summary":"","body":"A place you normally overlook may suddenly feel welcoming. A conversation with someone new may leave you feeling more understood than the familiar crowd does. You may also feel unexpectedly protective of a plan you have barely admitted you want.\n\nThe feeling may only last a day or two. That does not make it meaningless, but it does mean one emotional afternoon does not need to reorganize your life. The Moon conjunct your North Node today is better for noticing than deciding. Write down what felt possible before the mood changes.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/moon/north-node/conjunction","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"A place you normally overlook may suddenly feel welcoming. A conversation with someone new may leave you feeling more understood than the familiar crowd does. You may also feel unexpectedly protective of a plan you have barely admitted you want.\n\nThe feeling may only last a day or two. That does not make it meaningless, but it does mean one emotional afternoon does not need to reorganize your life. The Moon conjunct your North Node today is better for noticing than deciding. Write down what felt possible before the mood changes.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Rudhyar, Lunar Nodes (transit principle)","Spring, North Node Astrology","Jones, Healing the Soul","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A familiar situation can feel different to {{Name}} because an unfamiliar next step