at relief is meaningful, but it is not a promise about how long the connection will last.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/venus/north-node/conjunction","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Someone may enter your life through the work, community, interest, or creative practice you have only recently begun taking seriously. The connection feels different because it meets the person you are becoming, rather than returning you to the version everyone else already knows.\n\nA friendship, attraction, or collaboration may matter because it supports what you are trying to build. Venus {{aspectWord}} your North Node until {{untilDate}} can make a new chapter feel less lonely. That relief is meaningful, but it is not a promise about how long the connection will last.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","source_keys":["Rudhyar, Lunar Nodes (transit principle)","Spring, North Node Astrology","Jones, Healing the Soul","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored final, chat 2026-07-28","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"{{Name}} may notice what they actually value through an ordinary choice involving a choice that develops something new. An introduction, assignment, class, or invitation can put them close to people who already seem comfortable doing what they are just beginning. The two concerns sit close together now, so social ease changing how the offer lands immediately changes how {{Name}} experiences the situation instead of arriving as a separate issue.\n\nAs Venus {{aspectWord}} their North Node continues through {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} can let experience build the confidence instead of making confidence a prerequisite for beginning.","body_they_revie