"},"body_they":"Something that had been managed indirectly becomes harder for {{Name}} to keep managing that way, with a choice that develops something new showing where the power sits. An introduction, assignment, class, or invitation can put them close to people who already seem comfortable doing what they are just beginning. This is a direct contact, so pressure exposing the underlying issue is not happening in the background. It becomes part of the way {{Name}} handles the situation itself.\n\nThrough {{untilDate}}, Pluto {{aspectWord}} their North Node favors one practical response: {{Name}} can let experience build the confidence instead of making confidence a prerequisite for beginning.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"3f54295ba21a27984f67a1f5ed0521b0a1b394d6495b7e68940912c335a8831c","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"3f54295ba21a27984f67a1f5ed0521b0a1b394d6495b7e68940912c335a8831c","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"A role, relationship, or ambition may begin taking up more of your attention than expected. The pull can become intense enough to make the rest of your life look secondary. That is exactly why it needs time before it receives permanent authority.\n\nThe direction may be important. Intensity alone cannot tell you that. Move slowly enough to see what the role expects, what the relationship changes, and what the ambition would require you to give up. Pluto {{aspectWord}} your North Node u