y day worth spending on purpose.","body_they":"The day may give {{Name}} a little more cooperation than they expected. A reply arrives, a meeting takes less effort, or a plan advances without another round of pushing. That ease can be wasted if they only enjoy the relief and leave the same weak point waiting for a harder day.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Sun until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} has a useful window for checking what is working and strengthening the part that still depends on luck, another person's patience, or a temporary workaround. Easy progress is still progress. It is also a good time to make the next round easier.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.214Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","so