x later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The sentence {{Name}} has been trying to get right may finally come out cleanly today. A pitch, negotiation, class, contract discussion, or important call can move because they are able to explain the point without burying it under extra language. Other people are easier to understand too, especially when {{Name}} stays curious instead of rehearsing the next answer.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Mercury until {{untilDate}}, this is a useful day for the message that needs a clear response. They should say the important part while the words are available and leave enough space for the other person to answer it.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"79433b0a788d59b52bb89060e5d281c37cfabe718deadd7908a71f651d656f47","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","payloadSha256":"79433b0a788d59b52bb89060e5d281c37cfabe718deadd7908a71f651d656f47","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The mind is clear and the words land. A pitch, a negotiation, a contract, a class, the important call: language does what you mean today. The exchange may go your way, especially when you state it precisely and take real interest in the other side's view. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Mercury until {{untilDate}} favors saying the important thing today instead of Thursday.","body_they":"The sentence {{Name}} has been trying to get right may finally come out cleanly today. A pitch, negot