iewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Conversations may accelerate around {{Name}} before anyone has decided what actually needs to be settled. Plans change, someone revises an agreement, and a simple exchange can become an argument because both people are responding faster than they are listening. The pressure is useful when it exposes a weak idea early. It becomes noise when every disagreement has to be won.\n\n{{Name}} may get further by defending the point that matters and letting the rest remain unresolved for a day. With the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Mercury until {{untilDate}}, clear facts hold up better than speed, and listening long enough to understand the objection can save them from arguing against something the other person never said.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"796c705246a3f52d86fdb3d8f6161dd122a75d4a05f05c6ca0a02e28cc818c5d","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","payloadSha256":"796c705246a3f52d86fdb3d8f6161dd122a75d4a05f05c6ca0a02e28cc818c5d","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"The talking speeds up and so does the pushback. Ideas get tested, someone may change plans on you or walk back an agreement, and the paperwork multiplies. Arguments mostly start where broadcasting replaced listening. A position may survive the day intact when you defend it with facts and let the other person finish. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Mercury until {{untilDate}} is for reading results, not launching directions.","body_they":"Conversations may accelerate around {{Name}} before anyone has decided what actually needs to be settled. Plans change, someone revises an agreement, and a simple exchange can become an argument because both people are responding faster than they are listening. The pressure is useful when it exposes a weak idea early. It becomes noise when every disagreement has to be won.\n\n{{Name}} may get further by defending the point that matters and letting the rest remain unresolved for a day. With the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Mercury until {{untilDate}}, clear facts hold up better than speed, and listening long enough to understand the objection can save them from arguing against something the other person never said.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.215Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null}