:"","body":"Pleasure leads and drive follows at a distance. The purchase looks better than it is, the night out runs long, and in a couple, a hidden tension may pick today to surface. What drifts to you without effort is mostly not worth much; what surfaces in the relationship is worth looking at. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Venus until {{untilDate}} favors gracious over touchy, and a one-day pause on the impulse buy.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/sun/venus/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"Pleasure leads and drive follows at a distance. The purchase looks better than it is, the night out runs long, and in a couple, a hidden tension may pick today to surface. What drifts to you without effort is mostly not worth much; what surfaces in the relationship is worth looking at. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Venus until {{untilDate}} favors gracious over touchy, and a one-day pause on the impulse buy.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"{{Name}} may want the pleasant answer before they have checked what it costs. The purchase is easy to justify, the night runs later than planned, or a relationship tension surfaces at exactly the moment everyone would rather keep things easy. Avoiding the discomfort may preserve the mood for an hour and leave the actual issue untouched.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Venus until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} benefi