} is the day to make the request you have been sitting on.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something may go {{Name}}'s way with less resistance than expected today. A manager approves the request, a useful person answers, or a plan that had been waiting on someone else finally gets a yes. The opening matters most if they actually use it. Feeling optimistic without making the call, sending the proposal, or asking for what they want leaves the best part of the transit unused.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Jupiter until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} has a better window for the request they have been hesitating to make. They should be specific about what they want and give the other person something concrete to respond to.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"fc76db73ad376bd3d51f881d1408cd276b4054f39152a6de03f4424a3c20dad3","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","payloadSha256":"fc76db73ad376bd3d51f881d1408cd276b4054f39152a6de0