ate change to a stale routine lands well. Discipline is low; novelty is high. A daring move may earn respect, especially when it is chosen rather than reactive. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Uranus until {{untilDate}} favors shaking the routine on purpose.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something different may improve {{Name}}'s day more than something efficient. An old contact resurfaces, an ordinary interaction becomes unexpectedly interesting, or a small change to a stale routine gives them more energy than another attempt to be disciplined. The novelty is useful because it shows where the current pattern has become too narrow.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Uranus until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} can experiment without needing to reorganize everything. One deliberate change is enough to learn from. If it makes the day work better, they can decide later if it deserves to become part of the routine.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"b7196ffe13a4b4eed19de7b0c2d5475a21d9c24d171a16c814bee7c8b4e01f2d","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approval