ne, or simply having fewer demands can feel more restorative than trying to squeeze productivity out of low energy. This is not necessarily a problem to solve.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Neptune until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from following the softer rhythm of the day than from treating sensitivity as inefficiency. They can still do something meaningful. It may just be the kind of thing that restores them instead of producing another measurable result.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"54248d905796e1320079ef3f11b78dcce1f08698c9859c17ec76336c26707c25","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","payloadSha256":"54248d905796e1320079ef3f11b78dcce1f08698c9859c17ec76336c26707c25","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"Your tolerance for noise, competition, and packed schedules thins out. The day rewards dropping the effort to appear decisive when you're actually just tired. Helping someone, quiet hours, music, a film that lands: this is where the day goes right. Not the day to launch the colossal effort. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Neptune until {{untilDate}} restores more than it produces, and that is its job.","body_they":"{{Name}} may be less interested in competition, packed plans, or proving they can keep pace today. Quiet work, music, film, helping someone, or simply having fewer demands can feel more restorative than trying to squeeze productivity out of low energy. This is not necessarily a problem to solve.\n\nWith the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Neptune until {{untilDate}}, {{Name}} gets more from following the softer rhythm of the day than from treating sensitivity as inefficiency. They can still do something meaningful. It may just be the kind of thing that restores them instead of producing another measurable result.","positive_test":null,"intention":null,"ritual":null,"energy":null},"block_type":"fallback_article","lane":"serving","review_state":null,"evergreen":true,"evergreen_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.216Z","evergreen_by":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","facts":{"fallbackArchitectureV3":true,"packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"packageBucket":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"readerServing":true,"stageOnly":false,"sourceSchemaVersion":null},"knowledge_ids":[],"source_snapshot":{"contentType":"authored-content","content_role":"full_copy","review_status":"approved","positive_test":null,"approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKe