s when it serves the group and not just you. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} is the day to fix what has been broken for months.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"Something {{Name}} has been living around may become specific enough to address today. An old grievance finally gets named, a hidden expense becomes clear, or a difficult situation that kept producing consequences without an obvious cause reveals where the problem actually sits. Once it is concrete, {{Name}} can do something with it.\n\nOther people may be more willing to follow their lead when the solution helps more than one person. With the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Pluto until {{untilDate}}, influence works best when {{Name}} uses it to resolve the underlying problem rather than to prove they were the person who saw it first.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"a62090a0659633de2dd83a03b74439d9f58d26cd8bd0a880ac90605e10f5f2af","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends