more. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} points at the structural fault, and addressing it beats watching the same leak return.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/sun/pluto/hard","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":"","body_you":"An authority may demand you account for yourself today, an arrangement that was limping may break outright, and an ultimatum may appear from either side. Ultimatums issued today tend to backfire; the workable move is airing the grievance without forcing the ending, and not going it alone. A temporary fix reaches its limit today; the arrangement isn't doomed, but the quick patch won't hold the weight anymore. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} points at the structural fault, and addressing it beats watching the same leak return.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-approved fast-planet refresh, chat 2026-07-28 (Sun/Mercury reviewed; Venus/Mars pre-approved 'fix later')","approvedAt":"2026-07-28","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A disagreement around {{Name}} may reveal that the argument is not only about the stated issue. An authority figure pushes for control, an arrangement that has been barely holding together reaches its limit, or someone introduces an ultimatum because the quieter ways of managing the problem stopped working. The pressure shows where the structure is weakest.\n\n{{Name}} does not have to accept someone else's terms just because they were delivered forcefully. They also do not gain much by answering pressure with a larger threat. With the Sun {{aspectWord}} their Pluto until {{untilDate}}, the useful confrontation is the one that names the actual grievance, the actual leverage, and what has to change for the problem to stop returning.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"e4ca80ae7ad1b9416475cbacceb6c410a5cab4c1c68c774bfe68147c20578ae9","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-sun-proposed-v1.json","payloadSha256":"e4ca80ae7ad1b9416475cbacceb6c410a5cab4c1c68c774bfe68147c20578ae9","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":"An authority may demand you account for yourself today, an arrangement that was limping may break outright, and an ultimatum may appear from either side. Ultimatums issued today tend to backfire; the workable move is airing the grievance without forcing the ending, and not going it alone. A temporary fix reaches its limit today; the arrangement isn't doomed, but the quick patch won't hold the weight anymore. The Sun {{aspectWord}} your Pluto until {{untilDate}} points at the structural fault, and addressing it beats watching the same leak return.","body_they":"A disagreement around {{Name}} may reveal that the argument is not only about the stated issue. An authority figure pushes for control, an arrangement that has been barely holding together reaches its limit, or someone introduces an ultimatum because the quieter ways of managing the problem stopped working. The pressure shows where the structure is weakest.\n\n{{Name}} does not have to accept someone else's terms just because they were delivered forcefully. They a