tch 13 rev 2, 2026-07-29","source_keys":["Hand, Planets in Transit","Rodden, Modern Transits","Mars Transit Batch 13.html","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"importBatchId":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","sourcePackage":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","sourceFile":"authored-content","packageVersion":"v3-2026-09-03c","packageContentHash":"f8d4e7273d688f2374d07439295c0177","packageKeyManifestHash":"ad3b78b91851349d48f78053cada7089","packageKeyCount":9271,"packagePartition":"core","packagePartitionContentHash":"53f6cf94236e1da0dfd5ca865889d724","packagePartitionKeyManifestHash":"9a49ed285ab09ef4f98e4c0ef7f8c2d8","packagePartitionKeyCount":7478,"distributionState":null,"releaseBatch":null,"note":"V3 package mirror for dashboard editing. fallback_source rows are source material and must never render directly."},"reviewer_notes":"","prompt_version":"fallback-architecture-v3-2026-09-03c","provider":"tldrastro-fallback-architecture-v3","model":"manual","updated_at":"2026-09-04T14:21:31.219Z"},{"content_key":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/chiron/conjunction","surface":"you","mode":"feed","status":"LIVE","event_type":"transit-to-natal-aspect","target_date":null,"headline":"Conjunction","summary":"Phase 1 exact transit-aspect unit, imported verbatim.","body":"Transiting Jupiter conjunct your Chiron lands right on top of your raw edge for a couple of months, turning it all the way up right as good things start arriving. It surfaces as a new offer, a bigger stage, or praise that lands louder than you're used to hearing. Jupiter magnifies exactly where you've been trimming your own ambitions to fit what used to feel allowed. You don't have to downsize the offer to make it feel manageable. Take it at full size, and the sore spot gets quieter next to something that big instead of louder.","sections":{"packageRecord":{"contentKey":"authored/transit-aspect/jupiter/chiron/conjunction","content_role":"full_copy","surface":"transit-aspect","headline":null,"body":"Transiting Jupiter conjunct your Chiron lands right on top of your raw edge for a couple of months, turning it all the way up right as good things start arriving. It surfaces as a new offer, a bigger stage, or praise that lands louder than you're used to hearing. Jupiter magnifies exactly where you've been trimming your own ambitions to fit what used to feel allowed. You don't have to downsize the offer to make it feel manageable. Take it at full size, and the sore spot gets quieter next to something that big instead of louder.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","source_keys":["aspects-phase1-v1/aspect.jupiter.conjunction.chiron","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"note":"Phase 1 exact transit-aspect unit, imported verbatim.","approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-authored aspects-phase1-v1 package (final voice)","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"The larger option is easier for {{Name}} to imagine right now, especially around the history attached to a sore point. The useful clue is the part that feels older than the event itself, especially if the same reaction has shown up in very different situations. The immediate quality of the transit makes generosity becoming easier to promise feel personal even when the useful response is still practical and specific.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Chiron stays active. {{Name}} can acknowledge the sensitivity without giving it sole authority over the decision.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"171ea9296e3d174ad65fb3e860c3ae01659a1d064d5bcc30df9c3d543d69f404","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring",