uation look more promising to {{Name}}, with how they protect a familiar vulnerability becoming the place where expansion is most tempting. A joke, correction, delay, or careless comment can resemble something that used to hurt even when the current situation is smaller. {{Name}} can use a bigger appetite for possibility while the timing is cooperative instead of waiting for urgency to create momentum.\n\nThe decision point in Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Chiron through {{untilDate}} is simple: {{Name}} gets further by naming what was touched instead of demanding that the current moment explain every older hurt attached to it.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"e3a8468570b378b562f5ff9de25acc4d66da487cf062d1c16b8fbb60759515db","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_owner_approved","recordPath":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","payloadSha256":"e3a8468570b378b562f5ff9de25acc4d66da487cf062d1c16b8fbb60759515db","approvedAt":"2026-09-03"}},"body_you":null,"body_they":"An opening can make the whole situation look more promising to {{Name}}, with how they protect a familiar vulnerability becoming the place where expansion is most tempting. A joke, correction, delay, or careless comment can resemble something that used to hurt even when the current situation is smaller. {{Name}} can use a bigger appetite for possibility while the timing is cooperative instead of waiting for urgency to create momentum.\n\nThe decision point in Jupiter {{aspectWord}} their Chiron through {{untilDate}} is simple: {{Name}}