be about who feels considered, who keeps adjusting, and if both people are carrying the life they built together.\n\nSome connections can be rebuilt if both people are willing to name the problem and change the routine. In others, history, habit, or fear of being alone may be doing more of the work than affection. Saturn square Venus makes it difficult to keep calling familiarity closeness.","review_status":"approved","approved_via":"owner-final, TLDR-Lunation-Blend-Units-V1.md V2","source_keys":["TLDR-Lunation-Blend-Units-V1.md","packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json"],"approval":{"approvalLevel":"owner_signoff_untraced","evidence":"owner-final, TLDR-Lunation-Blend-Units-V1.md V2","migratedBy":"friends-owner-signoff-untraced-ruling-2026-08-13"},"body_they":"A limit becomes concrete for {{Name}}, and money, pleasure, and what they value is where the consequence is hardest to avoid. The attractive option may be worth choosing, but the useful question is what it costs in money, time, compromise, or future obligation. The pressure is informative if {{Name}} uses a deadline exposing what lacks support to identify the exact weak point instead of enlarging the argument.\n\nUntil {{untilDate}}, Saturn {{aspectWord}} their Venus stays active. {{Name}} does better when keeping the peace does not require ignoring the preference or cost that will still be there tomorrow.","body_they_review_status":"approved","body_they_sha256":"0d35c1b289c18d14ff7e6a5497ba7629377eca8187d8aa68edc7ae5774788156","body_they_approved_via":"packages/astro-knowledge/review/transit-aspect-friends-nonsun-350-owner-live-2026-09-03.json","body_they_authorship":"independent_friend_authoring","body_they_name_variable":"{{Name}}","body_they_sourceMechanism":"Explicit independently authored Friends passage. Runtime You-to-Friends conversion remains fallback-only for transit rows without explicit body_they.","body_they_approval":{"approvalLevel":"exact_ow